    {
      "id": "claim_c8a2fb5fd4ba47859c45deb55b034eac",
      "statement": "In a web application, `EngineSecurityBeansConfiguration` runs after `EngineAutoConfiguration`; its persistence/security port beans are conditional on missing beans, whereas it supplies `JwtServiceAdapter` when `TokenServicePort` is absent and wires the JWT filter from the selected token, user-details, and blacklist services.",
